# COMPONENT SPECIFICATIONS

## 1. Button

**Props:**
```typescript
interface ButtonProps {
  title: string;
  onPress: () => void;
  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'outline' | 'ghost' | 'danger';
  size?: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
  disabled?: boolean;
  loading?: boolean;
  icon?: React.ReactNode;
  iconPosition?: 'left' | 'right';
  fullWidth?: boolean;
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Variants:**
- primary: LinearGradient ['#3b82f6', '#2563eb'], white text, shadow
- secondary: Surface background, border, primary text
- outline: Transparent, 2px primary border, primary text
- ghost: Transparent, no border, primary text, opacity on press
- danger: LinearGradient ['#ef4444', '#dc2626'], white text, shadow

**Features:**
- Press animation (scale 0.97)
- Loading spinner (ActivityIndicator)
- Disabled state (opacity 0.5)
- Icon support (left/right)
- Use design tokens only

## 2. Input

**Props:**
```typescript
interface InputProps {
  value: string;
  onChangeText: (text: string) => void;
  placeholder?: string;
  label?: string;
  error?: string;
  secureTextEntry?: boolean;
  keyboardType?: KeyboardTypeOptions;
  autoCapitalize?: 'none' | 'sentences' | 'words' | 'characters';
  leftIcon?: React.ReactNode;
  rightIcon?: React.ReactNode;
  multiline?: boolean;
  numberOfLines?: number;
  editable?: boolean;
  maxLength?: number;
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**States:**
- Default: 1px border
- Focused: 2px primary border
- Error: 2px error border + error message
- Disabled: disabled background, opacity 0.6

**Features:**
- Focus animation
- Error message display
- Character counter (if maxLength)
- Icon support (left/right)

## 3. Card

**Props:**
```typescript
interface CardProps {
  children: React.ReactNode;
  variant?: 'default' | 'glassmorphism' | 'elevated' | 'outlined';
  onPress?: () => void;
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Variants:**
- default: Surface bg, 1px border, md shadow, lg radius
- glassmorphism: Blur effect, transparent bg, rgba border
- elevated: Surface bg, no border, lg shadow
- outlined: Transparent bg, 2px border, no shadow

**Features:**
- Pressable if onPress provided
- Press animation (scale 0.98)
- Theme aware

## 4. Badge

**Props:**
```typescript
interface BadgeProps {
  text: string;
  variant?: 'default' | 'primary' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'error' | 'info';
  size?: 'sm' | 'md';
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Variants:** Different background colors based on variant
**Sizes:** sm (12px text, 4/8 padding), md (14px text, 6/12 padding)
**Style:** Pill shape (full border radius), bold text

## 5. Avatar

**Props:**
```typescript
interface AvatarProps {
  source?: ImageSourcePropType;
  name?: string;
  size?: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg' | 'xl';
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Sizes:** sm: 32, md: 40, lg: 56, xl: 80
**Features:**
- Show image if source provided
- Show initials if name provided (no image)
- Default placeholder if neither
- Circular with border

## 6. Chip

**Props:**
```typescript
interface ChipProps {
  label: string;
  selected?: boolean;
  onPress?: () => void;
  icon?: React.ReactNode;
  onClose?: () => void;
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**States:**
- Unselected: Surface bg, border, text color
- Selected: Primary bg, white text

**Features:**
- Press animation
- Icon support
- Close button (X) if onClose provided

## 7. Divider

**Props:**
```typescript
interface DividerProps {
  orientation?: 'horizontal' | 'vertical';
  spacing?: 'xs' | 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Style:**
- Horizontal: width 100%, height 1px
- Vertical: width 1px, height 100%
- Border color, with margin based on spacing

## 8. IconButton

**Props:**
```typescript
interface IconButtonProps {
  icon: React.ReactNode;
  onPress: () => void;
  size?: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
  variant?: 'default' | 'primary' | 'ghost';
  disabled?: boolean;
  style?: ViewStyle;
}
```

**Sizes:** sm: 32, md: 40, lg: 48
**Variants:**
- default: Surface bg, border
- primary: Primary bg, white icon
- ghost: Transparent, icon color

## 9. Switch

**Props:**
```typescript
interface SwitchProps {
  value: boolean;
  onValueChange: (value: boolean) => void;
  disabled?: boolean;
}
```

**Features:**
- OFF: Disabled bg, white thumb
- ON: Primary bg, white thumb
- Smooth animation
- Use React Native Switch or custom

## 10. Checkbox

**Props:**
```typescript
interface CheckboxProps {
  checked: boolean;
  onPress: () => void;
  label?: string;
  disabled?: boolean;
